## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Rabhadh: script gan freagairt
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = Tá script ar an leathanach seo a d'fhéadfadh bheith gnóthach, nó gan freagairt. Tig leat an script a stopadh anois, nó is féidir leanadh ar aghaidh le feiceáil an gcríochnóidh an script.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Script: { $location }
# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = &Ná fiafraigh díom arís
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = Stop an script
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = Lean ar aghaidh
